===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|linette|lang=fro}}, from {{term|lin||flax|lang=fro}}, from the bird's fondness for the seeds of flax, the source of linen.

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɪnɪt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[passerine]] bird, {{taxlink|Carduelis cannabina|species}} in the [[finch]] family [[Fringillidae]], native to Europe, western Asia, and north Africa.

